{"id":10000065,"name":"久岐忍","enName":"Kuki Shinobu","title":"烦恼刈除","element":"雷","region":"稻妻","rarity":4,"weapon":"单手剑","birthday":"7月27日","constellation":"烦恼刈座","description":"干练可靠的「荒泷派」的副手——特别注明：干练可靠形容的不是「荒泷派」而是副手。","affiliation":"荒泷派","cv":{"chinese":"杨凝","japanese":"水桥香织","english":"基拉·巴克兰德","korean":"金燏"},"avatarImg":"assets/characters/10000065-avatar.webp","splashArt":"assets/characters/10000065-art.webp","hasLocalPack":false,"voicePackageUrl":"https://huggingface.co/datasets/simon3000/genshin-voice/resolve/main/speaker-archives/Chinese/501-plus/Kuki_Shinobu.zip","voicePackageEn":"Kuki_Shinobu","quoteCount":67,"friendLines":[{"title":"初次见面…","desc":"你好，我是荒泷派的二把手久岐忍。我们承包多种业务，货运物流、安保维持、房屋补漏、表演驻唱等等。需要我们请随时联系，这是我的名片，还请收下。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_draw_appear","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/71/241b1054hm4ls60n6umaxzq1yum4sjk.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·麻烦事","desc":"有麻烦事要处理的话，直接告诉我就好，我来摆平。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_character_idle_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/31/poy35fc6b1ahs21dlg1w0f2uedcioc5.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·证书","desc":"执业证书考试都有固定评判标准，肯学肯练就能考过，没什么难的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_character_idle_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4f/jq8j11v3634y3o2iqt1wla3av92p16s.mp3"},{"title":"闲聊·荒泷派","desc":"要是荒泷派犯了事，我会揪他们去认错的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_character_idle_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/24/pirplm65dmqsic8cc8a3hqm09g4gi7q.mp3"},{"title":"下雨的时候…","desc":"不用打伞了，腿脚快点就行。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_weather_heavyRain_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ce/iit1gl46o9sefffabgfb146ypxrauvi.mp3"},{"title":"打雷的时候…","desc":"当心点。这种天，应该没人会想引雷上身吧？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_weather_thunder_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/38/11r9aj0y8jsbcy044advnimfoxlqg96.mp3"},{"title":"下雪的时候…","desc":"快点把事情办完就撤吧，别浪费时间。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_weather_snowy_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/24/2ewax5ur4dv5j54axq62lifuhp0e036.mp3"},{"title":"阳光很好…","desc":"嗯，天气真好，但总有种不祥的预感…希望是我多虑了吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_weather_sunny_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/79/s2lqb1ynnewnqktgifum07y1drtlys7.mp3"},{"title":"刮大风了…","desc":"唔…这风还算不错。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_weather_gale_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0f/phk60pqvzo8vzn38tu5r9zuwdcsekwo.mp3"},{"title":"早上好…","desc":"早啊，看你的样子是准备去锻炼了？没想到你还挺勤快的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_dialog_greetingMorning","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f3/1sx4z4dstwlu9043oxcipdpy4obrjdu.mp3"},{"title":"中午好…","desc":"想吃什么？最近攒了不少钱，午饭我请你。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_dialog_greetingNoon","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4d/hb2xugxrf40s1y0b6ik2wfr3u1qcfsj.mp3"},{"title":"晚上好…","desc":"有些委托，在夜晚才好办。我不放心交给他们，都是我亲自上。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_dialog_greetingNight","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/omimixl7vj63wantgdll13vqshgrbi6.mp3"},{"title":"晚安…","desc":"该休息的时候就去休息吧，不用管我。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_dialog_greetingNight2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c2/9f1snu48mqrzkz1psm0ols6jwfulgsk.mp3"},{"title":"关于久岐忍自己·二把手","desc":"招揽业务、维系成员安定是我的职责，除此之外还有——去奉行所捞人，归还零食和玩具，抓捕接了活却在暗处偷懒的成员…不过，这些额外工作属于荒泷派特色，其他任何组织的二把手，理论上都不需要做这些。当然，也做不到像我这样。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_dialog_idle","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1e/3srguaxj0l8wjhmsced2otb9y4zqvzu.mp3"},{"title":"关于久岐忍自己·退路","desc":"你说帮派解散？首先，那种事应该不会发生。其次，就算发生了，我有什么好担心的呢。饿肚子的人不可能是我。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_dialog_idle2","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f2/puh3hn36wjbggcr9537w7ekd5vm1p8a.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·笔记","desc":"要是你心血来潮想考什么证，不如直接找我吧，我把笔记借你。备注和要点很详细，不愁你学不会。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_dialog_close","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fc/m4zzqoapbh216v7ge8pi2y5hycatfcn.mp3"},{"title":"关于我们·善后","desc":"不管你是不是荒泷派的人，我都不会把你当外人。你就往前走吧，幕后的工作交给我。放心，这方面我是专业的，多复杂的事都能办妥。嗯？担心我的安危？呵，这方面你也放心吧，这些年的摸爬滚打，不是白经历的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_dialog_close1","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/34/gdpow5vc23wuekiyz6x0imsfg0ja88d.mp3"},{"title":"关于「神之眼」…","desc":"和证书一样，这是对我能力的肯定和证明。但不同的是，我至今不知道它的考核标准。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_dialog_pendant","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/05/o7r5osciyim6ebf96gpqud73n1m9utv.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享·面铠","desc":"戴上面铠是不想被熟人认出来。尤其和荒泷派一起出任务时，要是熟人看见了，指指点点，那群家伙肯定会趁机起哄。啧，光是想想，就很烦。不能再有下次了…咳，没什么。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_dialog_share_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/24/pwoe8ij3z5bodesc1wo7crd9yl6rh7s.mp3"},{"title":"有什么想要分享·派中法度","desc":"我制定了荒泷派的「派中法度」，他们就应该谨遵法度行事。嗯？你问他们为什么愿意听话？因为我比他们更有说服力。我的语言和拳头，姑且还算是有点分量。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_dialog_share_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/12/4jdqxg4pymehejrsvm66xn8067nt7ll.mp3"},{"title":"感兴趣的见闻…","desc":"神社中流传着一种说法，将鸣草织成一个圈缠在身上，就能祛灾祈福，你信吗？我倒觉得，鸣草，还是麻痹效果更实用。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_pref_gift_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c9/m06oaetj7tsgi5kaz6ni7yopzo720i7.mp3"},{"title":"关于雷电将军…","desc":"解除锁国后，雷电将军陆续颁布了不少法令支持各行各业的发展。我在锁国期间考的证书全都派上了用场，荒泷派也不那么拮据了。祸福相依，没想到到头来还得感谢她。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_teammate_raidenShogun_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/3/37/5pz83jhjhxpme8td4cy0tx71a8wgvq3.mp3"},{"title":"关于九条裟罗…","desc":"九条小姐啊，她是我的朋友。嗯？我认识她让你觉得很意外吗？噢，你可能误会了，我加入荒泷派之前就跟她有交情。我们俩的切磋，还难分胜负呢。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_teammate_kujouSara_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/fc/2vranxcy8744hx526x9ad7lbinbmtfw.mp3"},{"title":"关于八重神子…","desc":"就连堂堂鸣神大社的宫司大人，都要靠副业来解闷，可见当巫女是有多无聊。我是绝对不会回去当巫女的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_teammate_yaeMiko_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/5/51/geepi2kua66ok6uwtzc8gxuw6imbgba.mp3"},{"title":"关于荒泷一斗…","desc":"老大有很多不算愉快的过去，却还能保持快乐阳光，挺难得的。他对我们很不错，他的纯粹也感染着荒泷派的大家。当然，这不能成为他横冲直撞影响别人的借口。如果他找你麻烦，尽管告诉我。我会好好收拾他，让他后悔对你无礼。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_teammate_itto_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6e/bbk7zgorfm80m4fpv4262s0n7tkrb6z.mp3"},{"title":"关于烟绯…","desc":"那时候跟家里闹翻了，只想着有多远逃多远，就跑去璃月学律法了。得亏这样，有幸认识了烟绯师姐。在律法咨询这块，她简直就是活字典。我？执业证书倒是有的，不过这个职业的约束也不少，并不是最适合我的。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_teammate_yanfei_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d6/t7k0trmrng5m80zm77fc4dk8ib3d9nk.mp3"},{"title":"关于鹿野院平藏…","desc":"他和普通天领奉行同心不一样，从未见他做什么巡逻、抓捕的活。他偶尔会找我买线索，作为交换，我希望他能在我去奉行所捞人时帮我美言几句，他也爽快答应了。这笔交易还算值，毕竟让弟兄们收集点市井见闻是很简单的事。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_teammate_heizou_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/21/aca7eourgrlwz8odxj6thiowi84w7ao.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解久岐忍·其一","desc":"我做过很多不同的工作，相关的执业证书也有不少。管理方面，带过小型团队，负责人员统筹和资源调配…呃，抱歉，面试多了就说习惯了，别介意。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_friendship_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/20/9opscwtevpzvp0iun6jfnop3t49jt6k.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解久岐忍·其二","desc":"我家是巫女世家，但我不适合当巫女。刚逃出来那会儿，我觉得要多积累，以免没有傍身之技。什么厨师、裁缝、格斗、律法咨询、出版编辑…我都学了。没想到真正进了社会才发现，学的已经完全够用了。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_friendship_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/6d/cs0gv3yqpug8z5aag1urfkrfdpzfa8l.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解久岐忍·其三","desc":"你说我社交场合很厉害？呵，毕竟在外流浪了那么久，总得学会察言观色。更何况在多数时候，理亏的那一方都是我们。我不讨厌摆出那些表情，但可以的话，我还是选择不笑的好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_friendship_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b6/crmf1sydq6rkjg2iqwdpx4zrd56fvga.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解久岐忍·其四","desc":"刚进荒泷派的时候，老大要我教小弟们怎么打架。所以我上来第一件事，就变成了把他们挨个揍趴下。没想到，一个个鼻青眼肿的，却睁大眼睛，张嘴就叫我「忍姐」，还要我好好带领他们。哼，那时候我就知道这是一群笨蛋。但没关系，笨蛋不会拖我后腿，我会解决一切问题。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_friendship_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/1f/n4m9qu7ch1awkxz9f4x7fkzkxtt5e2y.mp3"},{"title":"想要了解久岐忍·其五","desc":"留在荒泷派是我自己的选择。收拾烂摊子难免令人火大，但他们也给了我无可替代的真诚。最好的东西都先留给我、从不泼我冷水、在我宣布决定后闹哄哄地鼓掌吹口哨…我知道外面对荒泷派的评价不太好，他们自己也不在乎，但我还是想努努力，改变别人对我们的印象。因为，对待「家人」，自己可以偶尔抱怨，但就是不想其他人说他们的不好。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_friendship_05","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/65/g1s28jo4f5vyeaaglixn3ncckypr30r.mp3"},{"title":"久岐忍的爱好…","desc":"平时混帮派，闲着也是闲着，经常不小心读完一本书，不小心就把证考了。不也挺好吗？家里问起来，我也没虚度时光，出去谈工作，也算得上有资本。在这个凡事讲究实力的社会里，我这种有证书的混子，到哪里都能吃得饱饭。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_pref_hobby","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8a/0wbnpr8uwkgnhuql8m8pj1hkn3jker3.mp3"},{"title":"久岐忍的烦恼…","desc":"以前不想被抓回去当巫女，就决心只靠自己站稳脚跟。至少目前看来，我干得还不错。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_dialog_annoyed","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a3/plgzxtdcgfdy1ogpb8i1sxowvi7yng8.mp3"},{"title":"喜欢的食物…","desc":"就算刚吃过拉面或者饺子之类很管饱的食物，最后还是想以一小碗米饭结束。米饭好吃，没什么其他原因，有问题吗？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_pref_foodLike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/4/4c/4cq2pbtv7xxp5e21xn5rmavxn5uv5xb.mp3"},{"title":"讨厌的食物…","desc":"厨师证到手后，我就更加坚定那个从璃月听来的说法：没有难吃的食物，只有不合格的厨师。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_pref_foodDislike","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/c1/iynmdjpx464zhwlj78uejxrjuqjdorq.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其一","desc":"真不简单。咳…我就再多吃一口。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_spice_pref_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/b3/4srpgqo1fkecxwggo6osqondju7v0f6.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其二","desc":"你做的？嗯…这种水平去考个厨师证应该绰绰有余。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_spice_normal_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/27/b4cfcsf8ab0byxolgf0kdo3m7owjuqu.mp3"},{"title":"收到赠礼·其三","desc":"我直说吧，你是不是放错调料了？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_spice_dislike_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/8f/pctn9od0kwm90tadjtbktuf5uyzj5on.mp3"},{"title":"生日…","desc":"生日快乐，来，这个鸣草特制飞镖送给你。小心点，嗯，对，要像这样拿…投掷前记得计算弧度。呵呵，看你喜欢我就放心了。哦，别把它当玩具，还是有一定危险性的。想多训练一下的话，我来教你。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_pref_birthday_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/digreoqec0i6uvah09iy8ee2yye7kjq.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·起","desc":"基本功不过关，就什么都不用谈了。这就是初级证书的意义。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_starUp_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/8/80/kwm894oiy2cyktld8tl75ih59cpqkms.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·承","desc":"中级证书到手，已经可以处理大多数麻烦了。有什么麻烦事需要我帮你解决？","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_starUp_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/04/jlrlnonclmg9d3xm45fagszul54c6uq.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·转","desc":"高级证书绝不是轻易就能得到的，天赋和实战的累积缺一不可。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_starUp_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/d9/lsrw9zazrnx0x190s6o47u2z9ffnij4.mp3"},{"title":"突破的感受·合","desc":"证书只能用来评判技能的专业程度，无法对付出或情感的投入进行量化。你我的交情也不能只用一句感谢来表达，还是用我最擅长的行动来说明一切吧。","voicefile":"VO_friendship/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_starUp_04","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/ae/cnfxpnc4fptsy7tr9rmxqpffhe3phw9.mp3"}],"actionLines":[{"title":"元素战技·其一","desc":"鸣草结环！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_battle_skill1_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/18/mr7oe6liruuvlcul8xn7lv61268v91v.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其二","desc":"解厄！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_battle_skill1_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9e/iv0pjmlsr03v898lcufqlst62ubno8o.mp3"},{"title":"元素战技·其三","desc":"好好站稳了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_battle_skill1_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/2/28/t7tk0hdw51478jeqjn1lgz8zhuf4upf.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其一","desc":"给我…安分点！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_battle_skill3_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/b/bd/2fc97vcljd2nfdlqycc109djkrswhbg.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其二","desc":"祈雷…祓除！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_battle_skill3_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/09/j4o6opkne5c7kvxxcbvexzx6ve9kc88.mp3"},{"title":"元素爆发·其三","desc":"别来碍事。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_battle_skill3_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/94/ha54m531wn62lzkdpwh6tke02v5pqmb.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其一","desc":"嗯，积少成多。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_chest_open_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/a1/myycqsvro8mik712900xu85rmr4w0is.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其二","desc":"这票也稳了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_chest_open_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/77/9c6i1ymucz83t93pepfwot5nj83aq1o.mp3"},{"title":"打开宝箱·其三","desc":"你的了。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_chest_open_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/d/dd/j3g7ybgpmmymzas8r0rnp8yua2buaz6.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其一","desc":"给、我、站、住…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_life_less30_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0c/3s54b9pahz2lvidhm3dwn938qa5gmf7.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其二","desc":"算是惹怒我了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_life_less30_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/7/79/obof4vo5zsxuel8h9ok4j6qkjt11hy2.mp3"},{"title":"生命值低·其三","desc":"哼，该我了吧…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_life_less30_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ca/bkfo3vzmno8s43m7wy45ry59k9x45dx.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其一","desc":"我来善后。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_life_less30_teammate_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/62/s9ia1fclg399yt7a4v6bxl5mnq6yl7f.mp3"},{"title":"同伴生命值低·其二","desc":"行了交给我，别硬撑。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_life_less30_teammate_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/cb/t615i28vg73j3x3qnenuspvthqf954h.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其一","desc":"这次…是给人添麻烦了啊…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_life_die_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/90/7bsdk0dhohfno7e67dx7x2lyxpkq73e.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其二","desc":"荒泷派就拜托你了…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_life_die_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/aa/5ryf2jmxo24iwa20fmec3mjr8ht3m3x.mp3"},{"title":"倒下·其三","desc":"这是对我的…侮辱…","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_life_die_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/c/ce/8t0mun52v6hal5eazyvgeft9lbzpesz.mp3"},{"title":"普通受击·其一","desc":"再来。","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_battle_hit_L_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/6/63/3i1ccytmsgyfutjab3cvmst1ajdo45x.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其一","desc":"等着！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_battle_hit_H_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/0/0b/tsp1ocor454n1phen17gm7yfym6obuo.mp3"},{"title":"重受击·其二","desc":"找打是吧！","voicefile":"VO_gameplay/VO_shinobu/vo_shinobu_battle_hit_H_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/f/f0/60gv69rhrujmnnw5ei6llhib793vyht.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其一","desc":"看我眼色行动。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_shinobu_teamJoin_01","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/1/15/0x7q0qonvqg1w15q4owyagavd9uvd0g.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其二","desc":"这次是什么麻烦？","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_shinobu_teamJoin_02","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/a/aa/ejlu91kz60ucmn8k3xl91mckhs846uc.mp3"},{"title":"加入队伍·其三","desc":"希望不是烂摊子。","voicefile":"VO_teamJoin/vo_shinobu_teamJoin_03","localAudio":null,"audioUrl":"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/ys/9/9b/kto9kxjbp6svek7abta062uyt5n01w5.mp3"}],"cardArt":"assets/characters/10000065-card.webp","fullArt":"assets/characters/10000065-full.webp","fullArtWidth":1084,"fullArtHeight":967}